WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.152
Kẽer sẽn be koom-koglgã pʋgẽ wã yaa gãn-kãsems sẽn tar bĩis sẽn zãad n lebgd tẽngã zugu.

00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:11.519
Ned ka yõkd-b ye, ned ka wãbd-ba ye.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:14.512
B yetame tɩ b pa zĩm a taabã ye.

00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:21.154
B yeelame tɩ b na n yɩɩ koom gũudba, la tõe tɩ yaa bũmb wʋsg n yɩɩd rẽ.
